#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.2.rst:17
msgid ""
"**Security:** Fixed a bug where the CSRF filter could corrupt JSON "
"request bodies after successful verification when the CSRF token was "
"provided via the ``X-CSRF-TOKEN`` header. This caused "
"``IncomingRequest::getJSON()`` to fail on valid ``application/json`` "
"requests."
msgstr ""
"**Security:** CSRF 토큰이 ``X-CSRF-TOKEN`` 헤더를 통해 제공될 때 성공적인 검증 후 "
"CSRF 필터가 JSON 요청 본문을 손상시킬 수 있는 버그가 수정되었습니다. "
"이로 인해 유효한 ``application/json`` 요청에서 ``IncomingRequest::getJSON()``\\ 이 실패했습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.2.rst:21
msgid ""
"See the repo's `CHANGELOG.md "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/blob/develop/CHANGELOG.md>`_"
" for a complete list of bugs fixed."
msgstr ""
"수정된 버그의 전체 목록은 저장소의 `CHANGELOG.md "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/blob/develop/CHANGELOG.md>`_\\ 를 참조하세요."

